              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *modalu*, then *modalaneya*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "modalaneya, eraḍaneya, mūraneya",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *modalaneya, eraḍaneya, mūraneya*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "modalaneya dāri — the first road",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *modalaneya dāri* — the first road]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What word is ಮೊದಲನೆಯ (modalaneya) built on? (ಮೊದಲು, a beginning — not ಒಂದು.) Is the ending irregular too? (No — only the stem is.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
